# UI

Design mobile-first: 375 → 390 → 430, then tablet, then desktop.

Tokens live in `app/globals.css`. Do not introduce random hex values in components.

Typography: Syne for display/wordmark, Geist for UI. Large headings, small supporting text, almost no paragraphs.

Components in `components/soko/` wrap shadcn primitives. Reuse `Button`, `ProfileCard`, `Badge`, `Chip`, `BottomSheet`, `StatCard`, `VerificationBadge` — do not one-off similar UI.

Motion is subtle and functional: card spring, press, sheet physics, skeletons, like/match, gallery. No decorative animation.

Discover is a huge photograph with breathing room. Three actions only: Pass, Like, Spotlight.
